puts require zero changes. Each mismatched mirrored pair contributes two to the counter.\\n\\n7. **Complexity**:\\n   - Time Complexity: O(n), where n is the length of the array.\\n   - Space Complexity: O(1), as only a few variables are used.\\n\\n8. **Testing**:\\n   - Test with various cases including edge cases, arrays of different lengths, and arrays with repeated elements.\\n\\nEnsure all steps are followed to implement the function correctly."}'}]
